<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Slate-IQ | Player Evaluations</title>
<meta name="description" content="Data-driven DraftKings NFL Player Evaluations for Week 2, ranked by Slate-IQ Value Score (projected points per $1K salary) — updated weekly all season."/>
<meta property="og:type" content="website"/>
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Slate-IQ"/>
<meta property="og:title" content="Slate-IQ | Player Evaluations"/>
<meta property="og:description" content="Data-driven DraftKings NFL Player Evaluations for Week 2, ranked by Slate-IQ Value Score (projected points per $1K salary) — updated weekly all season."/>
<meta property="og:url" content="https://slate-iq.com/slate-iq-evaluations.html"/>
<meta property="og:image" content="https://slate-iq.com/og-image.png"/>
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/>
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/>
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/>
<meta name="twitter:site" content="@DFS_SlateIQ"/>
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Slate-IQ | Player Evaluations"/>
<meta name="twitter:description" content="Data-driven DraftKings NFL Player Evaluations for Week 2, ranked by Slate-IQ Value Score (projected points per $1K salary) — updated weekly all season."/>
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://slate-iq.com/og-image.png"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'"/>
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></noscript>
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;border:0 solid #e5e7eb}
html{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background:#fff;color:#0B2545}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
ul{list-style:none}
:root{
  --green:#00A94F;--green-dark:#007A38;--green-light:#E6F7ED;--green-border:rgba(0,169,79,0.3);
  --navy:#0B2545;--navy-dark:#081B33;--navy-light:#13345C;
  --gray-50:#f9fafb;--gray-100:#f3f4f6;--gray-200:#e5e7eb;
  --blue:#3B82F6;--blue-light:rgba(59,130,246,0.12);
  --gold:#D97706;--gold-light:rgba(217,119,6,0.12);
  --purple:#7C3AED;--purple-light:rgba(124,58,237,0.12);
  --red:#DC2626;--red-light:rgba(220,38,38,0.1);
}
.container{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}
@media(min-width:1024px){.container{padding:0 2rem}}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-100)}
nav{max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem;height:4rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.nav-logo-svg{height:32px;width:auto}
.nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.25rem}
.nav-back{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;color:rgba(11,37,69,.7);transition:color .15s}
.nav-back:hover{color:var(--green)}
.nav-back svg{width:1rem;height:1rem;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2}
.page-hero{background:linear-gradient(to bottom,var(--navy-light),var(--navy));color:#fff;padding:6rem 0 4rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
@media(min-width:1024px){.page-hero{padding:8rem 0 5rem}}
.page-hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.08;pointer-events:none}
.hero-eyebrow{display:inline-block;background:rgba(0,169,79,.15);color:rgba(230,247,237,1);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.025em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:.25rem .75rem;border-radius:9999px;margin-bottom:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--green-border)}
.page-hero h1{font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1rem}
@media(min-width:640px){.page-hero h1{font-size:3rem}}
.page-hero p{font-size:1.0625rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);max-width:38rem;line-height:1.65}
.disclaimer-band{background:rgba(0,169,79,.07);border-bottom:1px solid var(--green-border)}
.disclaimer-inner{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.75rem;padding:1rem 1.5rem;max-width:80rem;margin:0 auto}
@media(min-width:1024px){.disclaimer-inner{padding:1rem 2rem}}
.disclaimer-icon{flex-shrink:0;width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;stroke:var(--green);fill:none;stroke-width:2;margin-top:.1rem}
.disclaimer-text{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.55}
.disclaimer-text strong{color:var(--green-dark);font-weight:600}
.filters-bar{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-100);padding:.875rem 0;position:sticky;top:4rem;z-index:40}
.filters-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.filter-label{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:rgba(11,37,69,.4);margin-right:.25rem}
.filter-btn{font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;background:none;border:1px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:.375rem;padding:.35rem .875rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.75);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.filter-btn:hover,.filter-btn.active{background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green-dark);border-color:var(--green-border)}
.filter-sep{width:1px;height:1.25rem;background:var(--gray-200);margin:0 .25rem}
.evals-section{padding:2.5rem 0 6rem;background:var(--gray-50)}
.section-group{margin-bottom:3rem}
.group-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.group-badge{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:.3rem .9rem;border-radius:9999px}
.group-badge-core{background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green-dark);border:1px solid var(--green-border)}
.group-badge-watch{background:var(--gold-light);color:var(--gold);border:1px solid rgba(217,119,6,0.25)}
.group-badge-featured{background:var(--blue-light);color:var(--blue);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25)}
.group-title{font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
.group-count{font-size:.8125rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.4);font-weight:500}
.group-line{flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--gray-200)}
.eval-grid{display:grid;gap:1.25rem}
@media(min-width:640px){.eval-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:1024px){.eval-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
.eval-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--gray-100);border-radius:.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.05);transition:box-shadow .2s,transform .2s;cursor:pointer}
.eval-card:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 16px -4px rgba(0,0,0,.1);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.pos-bar{height:3px}
.pos-bar-qb{background:var(--green)}
.pos-bar-rb{background:var(--blue)}
.pos-bar-wr{background:var(--gold)}
.pos-bar-te{background:var(--purple)}
.pos-bar-dst{background:var(--red)}
.eval-card-body{padding:1.25rem;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.eval-card-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:.7rem}
.pos-badge{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;padding:.2rem .55rem;border-radius:.25rem}
.pos-badge-qb{background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green-dark)}
.pos-badge-rb{background:var(--blue-light);color:var(--blue)}
.pos-badge-wr{background:var(--gold-light);color:var(--gold)}
.pos-badge-te{background:var(--purple-light);color:var(--purple)}
.pos-badge-dst{background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red)}
.rec-badge{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:.2rem .55rem;border-radius:.25rem}
.rec-core{background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green-dark)}
.rec-strong{background:var(--blue-light);color:var(--blue)}
.rec-watch{background:var(--gold-light);color:var(--gold)}
.rec-value{background:rgba(156,163,175,.15);color:rgba(11,37,69,.5)}
.eval-name{font-size:1rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:.15rem;line-height:1.2}
.eval-team{font-size:.75rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.45);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.7rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}
.eval-summary{font-size:.8125rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.65);line-height:1.55;flex:1;margin-bottom:.85rem}
.eval-mini-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.375rem;margin-bottom:.85rem}
.mini-stat{background:var(--gray-50);border-radius:.375rem;padding:.45rem .35rem;text-align:center}
.mini-stat-val{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
.mini-stat-key{font-size:.6rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:rgba(11,37,69,.4);margin-top:.1rem}
.eval-card-footer{padding:.75rem 1.25rem;border-top:1px solid var(--gray-100);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.eval-salary{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:rgba(11,37,69,.45)}
.eval-salary span{color:var(--green);font-weight:700}
.eval-arrow{width:1rem;height:1rem;stroke:rgba(11,37,69,.25);fill:none;stroke-width:2;transition:all .2s}
.eval-card:hover .eval-arrow{stroke:var(--green);transform:translateX(3px)}
.modal-overlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.65);z-index:200;overflow-y:auto;padding:1.5rem}
.modal-overlay.open{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center}
.modal{background:#fff;border-radius:1rem;max-width:52rem;width:100%;margin:auto;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
@keyframes mo{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.modal{animation:mo .25s ease}
.modal-top-bar{height:4px}
.modal-header{padding:2rem 2rem 1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-100)}
.modal-badges{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:.85rem}
.modal-close{margin-left:auto;background:none;border:1px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:.375rem;padding:.35rem .75rem;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:rgba(11,37,69,.5);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.modal-close:hover{color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green)}
.modal-name{font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.modal-team-line{font-size:.8125rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.45);font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
.modal-stats-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--gray-100)}
.modal-stat-cell{padding:.875rem;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--gray-100)}
.modal-stat-cell:last-child{border-right:none}
.modal-stat-val{font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--green)}
.modal-stat-key{font-size:.6rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:rgba(11,37,69,.4);margin-top:.2rem}
.modal-body{padding:1.75rem 2rem}
.modal-section{margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.modal-section:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.ms-heading{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:.65rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
.ms-heading::after{content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--gray-100)}
.ms-body{font-size:.9375rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.7);line-height:1.7}
.ms-body strong{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}
.str-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.65rem;margin-top:.65rem}
.str-item,.con-item{font-size:.8125rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.65);line-height:1.5;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.4rem}
.str-item::before{content:'✓';color:var(--green);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}
.con-item::before{content:'△';color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0}
.outlook-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.875rem;margin-top:.65rem}
.outlook-box{background:var(--gray-50);border:1px solid var(--gray-100);border-radius:.5rem;padding:.875rem 1rem}
.outlook-label{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-bottom:.35rem}
.outlook-label.cash{color:var(--green-dark)}
.outlook-label.gpp{color:var(--gold)}
.outlook-body{font-size:.8125rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.65);line-height:1.6}
.modal-callout{background:var(--green-light);border-left:3px solid var(--green);border-radius:0 .375rem .375rem 0;padding:.875rem 1.125rem;margin-top:1.25rem}
.callout-label{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--green-dark);margin-bottom:.3rem}
.callout-body{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.6}
.modal-question{background:var(--gray-50);border:1px solid var(--gray-100);border-radius:.5rem;padding:.875rem 1.125rem;margin-top:1rem}
.q-label{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;color:rgba(11,37,69,.4);margin-bottom:.35rem}
.q-text{font-size:.875rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.65);font-style:italic;line-height:1.55}
.modal-footer{padding:1.25rem 2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--gray-100);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem}
.modal-salary{font-size:.875rem;color:rgba(11,37,69,.5);font-weight:600}
.modal-salary span{color:var(--green);font-weight:700;font-size:1rem}
.btn-primary{display:inline-block;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:.875rem;padding:.5rem 1.1rem;border-radius:.25rem;transition:background .15s}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--green-dark)}
.btn-outline{display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:rgba(11,37,69,.75);font-weight:600;font-size:.875rem;padding:.5rem 1.1rem;border-radius:.25rem;border:1px solid var(--gray-200);transition:all .15s}
.btn-outline:hover{color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green-border)}
.modal-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.8125rem;margin-top:.65rem}
.modal-table th{text-align:left;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:rgba(11,37,69,.4);padding:.4rem .65rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-100)}
.modal-table td{padding:.55rem .65rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-50);color:rgba(11,37,69,.65)}
.modal-table td:first-child{font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)}
.modal-table td.hi{color:var(--green);font-weight:700}
.modal-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
footer{background:var(--navy-dark);color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);padding:2.5rem 0}
.footer-inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;font-size:.875rem}
@media(min-width:640px){.footer-inner{flex-direction:row}}
.footer-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:1.5rem}
.footer-links a:hover{color:#fff;transition:color .15s}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  <defs>
    <symbol id="badge" viewBox="0 0 300 300">
      <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="145" fill="#081B33"/>
      <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="145" fill="none" stroke="#00A94F" stroke-width="6"/>
      <line x1="75" y1="195" x2="205" y2="115" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <circle cx="75" cy="195" r="8" fill="#fff"/>
      <g transform="translate(220,100) rotate(-14) scale(1.9)">
        <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="27" ry="16" fill="#00A94F"/>
        <line x1="-16" y1="0" x2="16" y2="0" stroke="#081B33" stroke-width="2"/>
        <line x1="-10" y1="-4.5" x2="-10" y2="4.5" stroke="#081B33" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <line x1="-5" y1="-4.5" x2="-5" y2="4.5" stroke="#081B33" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <line x1="0" y1="-4.5" x2="0" y2="4.5" stroke="#081B33" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <line x1="5" y1="-4.5" x2="5" y2="4.5" stroke="#081B33" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <line x1="10" y1="-4.5" x2="10" y2="4.5" stroke="#081B33" stroke-width="1.6"/>
      </g>
    </symbol>
  </defs>
</svg>

<header>
  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">
      <svg class="nav-logo-svg" viewBox="0 0 220 46" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect x="0" y="3" width="128" height="40" rx="3" fill="#D7EFDE"/>
        <text x="64" y="33" font-family="Inter,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="26" font-weight="800" fill="#0B2545" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">SLATE</text>
        <rect x="128" y="3" width="56" height="40" rx="3" fill="#00A94F"/>
        <text x="156" y="33" font-family="Inter,Arial,sans-serif" font-size="24" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">IQ</text>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <a href="slate-iq-intro.html" class="nav-back">Introduction</a>
      <a href="slate-iq-essays.html" class="nav-back">Essays</a>
      <a href="slate-iq-lineups.html" class="nav-back">Lineups</a>
      <a href="index.html" class="nav-back">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/></svg>
        Main Site
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 800 400">
      <circle cx="700" cy="80" r="160" fill="#00A94F"/>
      <circle cx="30" cy="350" r="180" fill="#00A94F"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="position:relative">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Week 2 · 2026 NFL Season</p>
    <h1>Player Evaluations</h1>
    <p>Data-driven DraftKings Week 2 evaluations, ranked by Slate-IQ Value Score (projected points per $1K salary).</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="disclaimer-band">
  <div class="disclaimer-inner">
    <svg class="disclaimer-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
    <p class="disclaimer-text"><strong>Live Week 2 Evaluations:</strong> These grades are built on 2026 Week 2 matchup data, DraftKings salaries, and Vegas lines. They'll be updated each week as new slates, injury reports, and lineup news roll in.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="filters-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="filters-inner">
      <span class="filter-label">Filter:</span>
      <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="filterCards('all',this)">All</button>
      <div class="filter-sep"></div>
      <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCards('QB',this)">QB</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCards('RB',this)">RB</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCards('WR',this)">WR</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCards('TE',this)">TE</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCards('DST',this)">D/ST</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="evals-section">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-group" id="core-group">
      <div class="group-header">
        <span class="group-badge group-badge-core">⭐ Week 2 Evaluations</span>
        <span class="group-count">11 Core Plays · 2 Value Plays</span>
        <div class="group-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="eval-grid">
        <div class="eval-card" data-pos="QB" data-tier="core" onclick="openModal('tlawrence')">
          <div class="pos-bar pos-bar-qb"></div>
          <div class="eval-card-body">
            <div class="eval-card-meta"><span class="pos-badge pos-badge-qb">QB</span><span class="rec-badge rec-core">Core Play</span></div>
            <div class="eval-name">Trevor Lawrence</div><div class="eval-team">Jacksonville Jaguars</div>
            <p class="eval-summary">Core Play (Cash) in Week 2 (22.15 proj, $5,800, best QB Value at 3.82) — Week 1 actuals and the matchup model agree, a genuinely safe floor under a stable Coen/Udinski staff.</p>
            <div class="eval-mini-stats">
              <div class="mini-stat"><div class="mini-stat-val">22.15</div><div class="mini-stat-key">Proj. DK</div></div>
              <div class="mini-stat"><div class="mini-stat-val">3.82x</div><div class="mini-stat-key">Value</div></div>
              <div class="mini-stat"><div class="mini-stat-val">$5,800</div><div class="mini-stat-key">Salary</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="eval-card-footer"><div class="eval-salary">DK Salary <span>$5,800</span></div><svg class="eval-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></div>
        </div>

        <div class="eval-card" data-pos="RB" data-tier="core" onclick="openModal('bijan')">
          <div class="pos-bar pos-bar-rb"></div>
          <div class="eval-card-body">
            <div class="eval-card-meta"><span class="pos-badge pos-badge-rb">RB</span><span class="rec-badge rec-core">Core Play</span></div>
            <div class="eval-name">Bijan Robinson</div><div class="eval-team">Atlanta Falcons</div>
            <p class="eval-summary">Core Play (Cash, Leverage) in Week 2 (25.16 proj, $8,200) — Week 1 actuals and matchup model both agree; elite dual-threat volume with no backfield competition.</p>
